('igot-clean-28', 'Introduction to Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, 2023', '15m 38s', 'Karmayogi Bharat', 'This course provides an overview of changes introduced in the Indian Evidence Act and deals with evidence-related reforms, specifically admissibility and appreciation of electronic evidence, following the introduction of the Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, 2023.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Introduction to Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, 2023', 'Karmayogi Bharat', 'This course provides an overview of changes introduced in the Indian Evidence Act and deals with evidence-related reforms, specifically admissibility and appreciation of electronic evidence, following the introduction of the Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, 2023.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-29', 'Introduction to Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023', '1h 22m', 'Karmayogi Bharat', 'This course provides an overview of changes introduced in the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 and deals with procedural reforms relating to crime reporting, investigation, prosecution and trial of offences following the introduction of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Introduction to Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023', 'Karmayogi Bharat', 'This course provides an overview of changes introduced in the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 and deals with procedural reforms relating to crime reporting, investigation, prosecution and trial of offences following the introduction of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023.', true, NOW()),
