('igot-clean-31', 'SAFETY, ACCIDENT PREVENTION AND DISASTER MANAGEMENT', '11h 37m', 'Ministry of Road Transport and Highways', 'The course module helps in better understanding of safety aspects to be adopted at workplace in power distribution and provides knowledge about measures to take care in prevention of accidents and disaster management plans.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'SAFETY, ACCIDENT PREVENTION AND DISASTER MANAGEMENT', 'Ministry of Road Transport and Highways', 'The course module helps in better understanding of safety aspects to be adopted at workplace in power distribution and provides knowledge about measures to take care in prevention of accidents and disaster management plans.', true, NOW()),
