('igot-clean-40', 'Cash Book and Bank Book', '2h 29m', 'National Academy of Direct Taxes (NADT)', 'The course covers Cash Book and Bank Book, rules of debit and credit, different types of Cash Books, and reconciliation. The supplied description is truncated.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Cash Book and Bank Book', 'National Academy of Direct Taxes (NADT)', 'The course covers Cash Book and Bank Book, rules of debit and credit, different types of Cash Books, and reconciliation. The supplied description is truncated.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-41', 'Depot operations in FCI', '25m 1s', 'Food Corporation of India (FCI)', 'Depot operations are the backbone of the functioning of FCI, which is committed to ensuring uninterrupted food grain supply across the nation. Understanding basic depot operations is crucial for FCI staff for successful running, monitoring, and implementing government policies.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Depot operations in FCI', 'Food Corporation of India (FCI)', 'Depot operations are the backbone of the functioning of FCI, which is committed to ensuring uninterrupted food grain supply across the nation. Understanding basic depot operations is crucial for FCI staff for successful running, monitoring, and implementing government policies.', true, NOW()),
