('igot-clean-43', 'Mobile Base Station and its Maintenance', '2h 14m', 'Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)', 'This course includes Base Station infrastructure elements and their maintenance. It focuses on Tejas Make 4G eNodeB and its components deployed under BSNL''s indigenous 4G Phase IX.2 project, supporting proper maintenance of these base stations.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Mobile Base Station and its Maintenance', 'Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)', 'This course includes Base Station infrastructure elements and their maintenance. It focuses on Tejas Make 4G eNodeB and its components deployed under BSNL''s indigenous 4G Phase IX.2 project, supporting proper maintenance of these base stations.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-44', 'Maintenance of Land and Building Assets', '2h 14m', 'Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)', 'This course covers BSNL''s policy for renting vacant built-up space and residential accommodation, monetization of under-utilized land and building assets, and guidelines for planning, execution, and maintenance of construction projects undertaken by CPWD and REM in SAP.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Maintenance of Land and Building Assets', 'Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)', 'This course covers BSNL''s policy for renting vacant built-up space and residential accommodation, monetization of under-utilized land and building assets, and guidelines for planning, execution, and maintenance of construction projects undertaken by CPWD and REM in SAP.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-45', 'Input Tax Credit (ITC) Mechanism', '4h 46m', 'Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs (CBIC)', 'This course discusses Input Tax Credit in GST, including eligibility and conditions, utilization and matching through returns and GSTR-2B, ineligible credit and reversal, and ITC under special circumstances.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Input Tax Credit (ITC) Mechanism', 'Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs (CBIC)', 'This course discusses Input Tax Credit in GST, including eligibility and conditions, utilization and matching through returns and GSTR-2B, ineligible credit and reversal, and ITC under special circumstances.', true, NOW()),
