('igot-clean-47', 'Public - Private Partnership', '1h 50m', 'ISB Hyderabad', 'This course provides an overview of Public-Private Partnerships (PPPs) as a model for delivering public services. It covers the strengths and weaknesses of public and private sectors, advantages of PPPs, partner motivations, different forms and structures, and risks and responsible parties.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Public - Private Partnership', 'ISB Hyderabad', 'This course provides an overview of Public-Private Partnerships (PPPs) as a model for delivering public services. It covers the strengths and weaknesses of public and private sectors, advantages of PPPs, partner motivations, different forms and structures, and risks and responsible parties.', true, NOW()),
