('igot-clean-110', '3h 45m', 'ISB Hyderabad', 'This Negotiation course explores four key components: understanding distributive negotiations, exploring value creation, handling dispute resolution encompassing emotions and principles, and navigating multi-party negotiations as observed in international arenas. Learners can anticipate an immersive learning experience, exploring these concepts through quizzes and real-world insights, enhancing their negotiation skills comprehensively.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '3h 45m', 'This Negotiation course explores four key components: understanding distributive negotiations, exploring value creation, handling dispute resolution encompassing emotions and principles, and navigating multi-party negotiations as observed in international arenas. Learners can anticipate an immersive learning experience, exploring these concepts through quizzes and real-world insights, enhancing their negotiation skills comprehensively.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-111', '1h 30m', 'Wadhwani Institute of Technology and Policy', 'We are thrilled to present an exclusive course on AI for Digital Transformation: Machine Learning and Deep Learning, meticulously designed for the Government of India and State Government officers. This course promises to empower you with the knowledge and understanding of this advanced technology, helping you harness its enormous potential in your respective fields. Embrace the future of efficient governance and public service, where machines and humans work together in perfect harmony, transforming ideas into reality, and reality into a masterpiece. Welcome aboard on this riveting journey into the future. Together, let''s steer our nation towards a technologically advanced and progressive tomorrow.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '1h 30m', 'We are thrilled to present an exclusive course on AI for Digital Transformation: Machine Learning and Deep Learning, meticulously designed for the Government of India and State Government officers. This course promises to empower you with the knowledge and understanding of this advanced technology, helping you harness its enormous potential in your respective fields. Embrace the future of efficient governance and public service, where machines and humans work together in perfect harmony, transforming ideas into reality, and reality into a masterpiece. Welcome aboard on this riveting journey into the future. Together, let''s steer our nation towards a technologically advanced and progressive tomorrow.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-112', '1h 21m', 'Civis', 'Public consultations are a fundamental aspect of contemporary governance, ensuring that policies and laws align with the needs and expectations of the citizens they affect. Designed exclusively for government officers, the Introduction to Public Consultations course designed by Civis (registered as a Section 8, non-profit company under the Indian Companies Act) offers a comprehensive exploration of this critical area. Delve into the complexities and responsibilities associated with public consultations to fulfil your role as a responsible and informed public servant. This course is applicable for all wrung of officers, who are involved in formal and informal consultation process at various levels of government. Importance for Government Officers Here’s why this course holds significant importance for government officers: - Legal Adherence: Gain the knowledge and skills necessary to navigate the legal intricacies of public consultations, ensuring compliance with the Pre-Legislative Consultation Policy (PLCP). - Global Insights: Investigate international best practices to elevate the quality of your consultations, making them more inclusive and effective. - Enhanced Engagement: Equip yourself with the expertise required to conduct consultations that collect meaningful feedback and integrate it into the policymaking process. - Community Outreach: Discover strategies for reaching even the most remote and underrepresented segments of the population, fostering a citizen-centric approach to governance.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '1h 21m', 'Public consultations are a fundamental aspect of contemporary governance, ensuring that policies and laws align with the needs and expectations of the citizens they affect. Designed exclusively for government officers, the Introduction to Public Consultations course designed by Civis (registered as a Section 8, non-profit company under the Indian Companies Act) offers a comprehensive exploration of this critical area. Delve into the complexities and responsibilities associated with public consultations to fulfil your role as a responsible and informed public servant. This course is applicable for all wrung of officers, who are involved in formal and informal consultation process at various levels of government. Importance for Government Officers Here’s why this course holds significant importance for government officers: - Legal Adherence: Gain the knowledge and skills necessary to navigate the legal intricacies of public consultations, ensuring compliance with the Pre-Legislative Consultation Policy (PLCP). - Global Insights: Investigate international best practices to elevate the quality of your consultations, making them more inclusive and effective. - Enhanced Engagement: Equip yourself with the expertise required to conduct consultations that collect meaningful feedback and integrate it into the policymaking process. - Community Outreach: Discover strategies for reaching even the most remote and underrepresented segments of the population, fostering a citizen-centric approach to governance.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-113', '1h 11m', 'Dr Marri Chenna Reddy Human Resource Development Institute of Telangana', 'ఉద్యోగులకు వారి ఉద్యోగ జీవితాన్ని సులభతరం మరియు సంతృప్తికరం చేసుకోవడానికి, సంస్థాగతమైన మరియు వ్యక్తిగతమైన విలువలకు మధ్య పొందిక ఉండేలా ఉద్యోగ స్థలం వద్ద ఒత్తిడిని తగ్గించుకోవడం ముఖ్యమైన సంగతి. సంస్థాగతమైన మరియు వ్యక్తిగతమైన విలువలకు వ్యక్తులు ఏ విధంగా కూర్పును కలిగి ఉండాలో ఈ మాడ్యూల్ తెలుపుతుంది.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '1h 11m', 'ఉద్యోగులకు వారి ఉద్యోగ జీవితాన్ని సులభతరం మరియు సంతృప్తికరం చేసుకోవడానికి, సంస్థాగతమైన మరియు వ్యక్తిగతమైన విలువలకు మధ్య పొందిక ఉండేలా ఉద్యోగ స్థలం వద్ద ఒత్తిడిని తగ్గించుకోవడం ముఖ్యమైన సంగతి. సంస్థాగతమైన మరియు వ్యక్తిగతమైన విలువలకు వ్యక్తులు ఏ విధంగా కూర్పును కలిగి ఉండాలో ఈ మాడ్యూల్ తెలుపుతుంది.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-114', '53m 17s', 'Genpact', 'Welcome to the "Integration of BPR, Lean, Six Sigma, and Design Thinking" module! We invite you to embark on a transformative journey where we delve into the seamless integration of BPR, Lean, Six Sigma, and Design Thinking. In an era of complex projects, cross-functional teams, and the need for strategic integration, this program equips you with the insights and skills needed to navigate the intricacies of process improvement effectively.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '53m 17s', 'Welcome to the "Integration of BPR, Lean, Six Sigma, and Design Thinking" module! We invite you to embark on a transformative journey where we delve into the seamless integration of BPR, Lean, Six Sigma, and Design Thinking. In an era of complex projects, cross-functional teams, and the need for strategic integration, this program equips you with the insights and skills needed to navigate the intricacies of process improvement effectively.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-115', '1h 43m', 'Genpact', 'Welcome to the "Design Thinking for Process Innovation" module, where innovation meets intentionality. This module is designed to demystify Design Thinking, starting with its definition and fundamental principles. We''ll explore the human-centered approach, emphasizing the crucial role of empathy in understanding user needs. Get ready to unleash your creative potential as we delve into techniques for ideation and rapid prototyping.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '1h 43m', 'Welcome to the "Design Thinking for Process Innovation" module, where innovation meets intentionality. This module is designed to demystify Design Thinking, starting with its definition and fundamental principles. We''ll explore the human-centered approach, emphasizing the crucial role of empathy in understanding user needs. Get ready to unleash your creative potential as we delve into techniques for ideation and rapid prototyping.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-116', '2h 45m', 'Indian School of Public Policy', 'Public policies play a crucial role in governance, impacting citizens'' lives and shaping a nation''s direction. However, hastily crafted policies, often based on the perceptions of a select few, can result in unintended consequences and may fail to address the broader public perspective. This course on Policy Writing, spread across 10 short modules, introduces the techniques of sound policy writing, grounded in effective writing and communication principles, to ensure the success and effectiveness of public policies.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '2h 45m', 'Public policies play a crucial role in governance, impacting citizens'' lives and shaping a nation''s direction. However, hastily crafted policies, often based on the perceptions of a select few, can result in unintended consequences and may fail to address the broader public perspective. This course on Policy Writing, spread across 10 short modules, introduces the techniques of sound policy writing, grounded in effective writing and communication principles, to ensure the success and effectiveness of public policies.', '', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-117', '15h 15m', 'National E-Governance Division (NEGD) MeitY Govt of India', 'Get a holistic view of the eGovernance Life Cycle (eGLC), from ideation to implementation, and eventual disposal. Understand the stages involved in developing, deploying, and maintaining e-governance solutions. involved in developing, deploying, and maintaining e-governance solutions.', '', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '15h 15m', 'Get a holistic view of the eGovernance Life Cycle (eGLC), from ideation to implementation, and eventual disposal. Understand the stages involved in developing, deploying, and maintaining e-governance solutions. involved in developing, deploying, and maintaining e-governance solutions.', '', true, NOW()),
