('igot-clean-121', 'Ministry of Mines - Technology and Innovation(Part 6)', '35m 6s', 'Ministry of Mines', 'This is the sixth module of the training program, focusing on international best practices in sustainable mining using evolving technologies like remote sensing, blockchain, and data analytics. It emphasizes technology''s crucial role in safety, efficiency, sustainability, and stakeholder engagement. The course also highlights Indian mining sector initiatives like Drone Surveys, Mining Surveillance Systems, Star Rating of Mines, and 5G adoption.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Ministry of Mines - Technology and Innovation(Part 6)', 'Ministry of Mines', 'This is the sixth module of the training program, focusing on international best practices in sustainable mining using evolving technologies like remote sensing, blockchain, and data analytics. It emphasizes technology''s crucial role in safety, efficiency, sustainability, and stakeholder engagement. The course also highlights Indian mining sector initiatives like Drone Surveys, Mining Surveillance Systems, Star Rating of Mines, and 5G adoption.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-122', 'Ministry Of Mines-Safety, Sustainability, Envr Responsibility (Part8)', '54m 3s', 'Ministry of Mines', 'This is the eighth module in our training program, offering a deep dive into safety, sustainability, and environmental responsibility within the mining sector. Participants will explore regulatory guidelines, health and safety standards, environmental policies, social impact assessment, sustainable development goals, and mine closure procedures. The course equips individuals with the knowledge and skills necessary for fostering responsible mining practices and ensuring the long-term sustainability of the mining industry.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Ministry Of Mines-Safety, Sustainability, Envr Responsibility (Part8)', 'Ministry of Mines', 'This is the eighth module in our training program, offering a deep dive into safety, sustainability, and environmental responsibility within the mining sector. Participants will explore regulatory guidelines, health and safety standards, environmental policies, social impact assessment, sustainable development goals, and mine closure procedures. The course equips individuals with the knowledge and skills necessary for fostering responsible mining practices and ensuring the long-term sustainability of the mining industry.', true, NOW()),
