('igot-clean-132', 'Advanced Concepts in SQL', '1h 21m', 'UpGrad', 'In this course, you’ll learn about several techniques that help you reduce query time. These range from optimizing queries to using constructs such as indexes.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Advanced Concepts in SQL', 'UpGrad', 'In this course, you’ll learn about several techniques that help you reduce query time. These range from optimizing queries to using constructs such as indexes.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-133', 'Sanction for Prosecution', '45m', 'Institute of Secretariat Training and Management', 'This course offers a deep dive into the legal intricacies of obtaining sanction for prosecution in India. Participants will explore the nuances of Section 197 of the Code of Criminal Procedure (CrPC), 1973, gaining a comprehensive understanding of its provisions. The Prevention of Corruption Act, 1988, will be thoroughly discussed, providing participants with a robust foundation in the legal framework governing anti-corruption efforts.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Sanction for Prosecution', 'Institute of Secretariat Training and Management', 'This course offers a deep dive into the legal intricacies of obtaining sanction for prosecution in India. Participants will explore the nuances of Section 197 of the Code of Criminal Procedure (CrPC), 1973, gaining a comprehensive understanding of its provisions. The Prevention of Corruption Act, 1988, will be thoroughly discussed, providing participants with a robust foundation in the legal framework governing anti-corruption efforts.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-134', 'Proficiency in technical and scientific writing', '1h 58m', 'Capacity Building Commission', 'This topic covers the essential skills needed for effective communication in technical and scientific contexts. It encompasses techniques for crafting clear, organized technical documents, mastering scientific writing principles, conducting research, and ensuring proper citation. Students will develop proficiency in grammar and mechanics, and learn how to provide constructive feedback through peer review. Emphasis is placed on maintaining originality and applying these skills in real-world scenarios, preparing individuals for success in professional and academic writing environments.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Proficiency in technical and scientific writing', 'Capacity Building Commission', 'This topic covers the essential skills needed for effective communication in technical and scientific contexts. It encompasses techniques for crafting clear, organized technical documents, mastering scientific writing principles, conducting research, and ensuring proper citation. Students will develop proficiency in grammar and mechanics, and learn how to provide constructive feedback through peer review. Emphasis is placed on maintaining originality and applying these skills in real-world scenarios, preparing individuals for success in professional and academic writing environments.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-135', 'Plagiarism', '41m 16s', 'Capacity Building Commission', 'The video on "What is plagiarism and how to avoid it" offers a concise explanation of plagiarism and provides practical strategies to prevent it. Viewers gain an understanding of plagiarism as the unauthorized use of someone else''s work and the importance of proper citation and attribution. The video also offers guidance on using quotations, paraphrasing, citing sources, and utilizing plagiarism detection tools. By following these tips, individuals can maintain academic integrity and avoid the pitfalls of plagiarism in their work.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Plagiarism', 'Capacity Building Commission', 'The video on "What is plagiarism and how to avoid it" offers a concise explanation of plagiarism and provides practical strategies to prevent it. Viewers gain an understanding of plagiarism as the unauthorized use of someone else''s work and the importance of proper citation and attribution. The video also offers guidance on using quotations, paraphrasing, citing sources, and utilizing plagiarism detection tools. By following these tips, individuals can maintain academic integrity and avoid the pitfalls of plagiarism in their work.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-136', '5G Air Interface Part 1', '50m', 'National Telecommunications Institute for Policy Research, Innovation and Training (NTIPRIT)', 'This is part 1 of 5G Air Interface Course. The Learners will be able to understand, Frequency bands, bandwidth, Waveform, Numerologies etc supported in 5G,', 'iGoT Karmayogi', '5G Air Interface Part 1', 'National Telecommunications Institute for Policy Research, Innovation and Training (NTIPRIT)', 'This is part 1 of 5G Air Interface Course. The Learners will be able to understand, Frequency bands, bandwidth, Waveform, Numerologies etc supported in 5G,', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-137', 'Landslides in India: An Introduction', '1h 25m', 'Ministry of Mines', 'This e-learning course of the Geological Survey of India Training Institute (GSITI) intends to enhance the understanding of the basics of the landslide phenomena, the landslide hazard scenarios of India, their triggers and consequences.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Landslides in India: An Introduction', 'Ministry of Mines', 'This e-learning course of the Geological Survey of India Training Institute (GSITI) intends to enhance the understanding of the basics of the landslide phenomena, the landslide hazard scenarios of India, their triggers and consequences.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-138', 'Financial Insights\:Trading,Profit and Loss and Balance Sheet', '46m 7s', 'National Institute of Communication Finance', 'The course "Financial Insights: Trading, Profit and Loss, and Balance Sheet" provides a comprehensive understanding of key financial concepts and statements used in business and accounting. Here''s a summary of what you might learn in this course: -Introduction to Financial Statements: -Definition and purpose of the income statement. -Definition and purpose of the Balance Sheet', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Financial Insights\:Trading,Profit and Loss and Balance Sheet', 'National Institute of Communication Finance', 'The course "Financial Insights: Trading, Profit and Loss, and Balance Sheet" provides a comprehensive understanding of key financial concepts and statements used in business and accounting. Here''s a summary of what you might learn in this course: -Introduction to Financial Statements: -Definition and purpose of the income statement. -Definition and purpose of the Balance Sheet', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-139', 'Concepts of Digital Signalling - Part 1', '35m', 'National Telecommunications Institute for Policy Research, Innovation and Training (NTIPRIT)', 'Signalling is exchange of Information between various nodes in the process of establishing and releasing a call between a calling party and a called party.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Concepts of Digital Signalling - Part 1', 'National Telecommunications Institute for Policy Research, Innovation and Training (NTIPRIT)', 'Signalling is exchange of Information between various nodes in the process of establishing and releasing a call between a calling party and a called party.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-140', 'E-Learning Modules on Basics of the Underwater World (Part-2)', '2h 33m', 'Maritime Research Foundation', 'In the second part of the course, the focus shifts towards advanced aspects of Underwater Domain Awareness (UDA) and its practical applications. The curriculum covers the Underwater Data Analytics Framework, providing insights into acoustic propagation in the Indian Ocean Region (IOR) and addressing underwater channel modeling, simulation, and field validation. Additionally, the course explores underwater robotics, including their challenges and opportunities, offering foundational knowledge, classification of applications, and insights into various types of Autonomous Underwater Vehicles (AUVs) and their design and development considerations. The discussion also extends to underwater deployment, emphasizing different deployment types, their applications, and the influence of tropical characteristics on sensor performance and safety. The course further addresses acoustic habitat degradation and management, highlighting underwater acoustics, sources of underwater noise, and marine spatial planning, with real-world examples such as Bubble Feeding by Big Whales. It concludes by examining the role of digital transformation in enhancing coastal communities'' livelihoods. This encompasses the digital ocean, the development of an APY analysis tool for seaweed cultivation and shrimp farming, as well as the governance perspective and challenges associated with the APY Tool. These five segments provide advanced insights into UDA, from data analytics and underwater robotics to digital transformation, expanding participants'' understanding of the multifaceted world of underwater domain awareness.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'E-Learning Modules on Basics of the Underwater World (Part-2)', 'Maritime Research Foundation', 'In the second part of the course, the focus shifts towards advanced aspects of Underwater Domain Awareness (UDA) and its practical applications. The curriculum covers the Underwater Data Analytics Framework, providing insights into acoustic propagation in the Indian Ocean Region (IOR) and addressing underwater channel modeling, simulation, and field validation. Additionally, the course explores underwater robotics, including their challenges and opportunities, offering foundational knowledge, classification of applications, and insights into various types of Autonomous Underwater Vehicles (AUVs) and their design and development considerations. The discussion also extends to underwater deployment, emphasizing different deployment types, their applications, and the influence of tropical characteristics on sensor performance and safety. The course further addresses acoustic habitat degradation and management, highlighting underwater acoustics, sources of underwater noise, and marine spatial planning, with real-world examples such as Bubble Feeding by Big Whales. It concludes by examining the role of digital transformation in enhancing coastal communities'' livelihoods. This encompasses the digital ocean, the development of an APY analysis tool for seaweed cultivation and shrimp farming, as well as the governance perspective and challenges associated with the APY Tool. These five segments provide advanced insights into UDA, from data analytics and underwater robotics to digital transformation, expanding participants'' understanding of the multifaceted world of underwater domain awareness.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-141', 'Science communication', '2h 10m', 'Capacity Building Commission', 'This comprehensive course is designed for scientists, researchers, and educators who want to master science communication. Participants will learn to articulate complex scientific ideas compellingly, fostering public discourse and enhancing societal trust in science. Covering writing, visuals, and social media, the course focuses on educating and informing citizens for evidence-based decision-making. Beneficiaries of this course will gain a deep understanding of the science communication landscape, benefiting those eager to broaden the impact of their scientific and research work and engagement with the public.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Science communication', 'Capacity Building Commission', 'This comprehensive course is designed for scientists, researchers, and educators who want to master science communication. Participants will learn to articulate complex scientific ideas compellingly, fostering public discourse and enhancing societal trust in science. Covering writing, visuals, and social media, the course focuses on educating and informing citizens for evidence-based decision-making. Beneficiaries of this course will gain a deep understanding of the science communication landscape, benefiting those eager to broaden the impact of their scientific and research work and engagement with the public.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-142', 'E-Learning Modules on Basics of the Underwater World (Part-1)', '2h 45m', 'Maritime Research Foundation', 'This comprehensive course on Underwater Domain Awareness (UDA) covers a wide spectrum of topics vital to understanding UDA''s role in contemporary maritime contexts. It begins with a foundational exploration of UDA, emphasizing its significance and key stakeholders. The course then delves into the strategic alignment of the UDA Framework with India''s SAGAR vision, offering insights into India''s global positioning and various projects that complement this vision. Next, it addresses the intricacies of UDA in tropical waters, considering political, economic, and historical challenges, while contextualizing UDA within the evolving Indo-Pacific strategy. The course also emphasizes sustainability concerns in the Indian Ocean, encompassing issues such as acoustic habitat degradation, IUU fishing, pollution, and ecosystem degradation, all within the context of India''s unique tropical characteristics. Finally, it highlights the need for effective maritime governance and the imperative of a UDA framework. This section discusses regulatory challenges, decision-making dynamics, and the role of the scientific community in managing underwater domains. By encompassing these five modules, the course provides participants with a holistic and in-depth understanding of UDA''s significance and its critical role in shaping maritime security and sustainability in the modern world.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'E-Learning Modules on Basics of the Underwater World (Part-1)', 'Maritime Research Foundation', 'This comprehensive course on Underwater Domain Awareness (UDA) covers a wide spectrum of topics vital to understanding UDA''s role in contemporary maritime contexts. It begins with a foundational exploration of UDA, emphasizing its significance and key stakeholders. The course then delves into the strategic alignment of the UDA Framework with India''s SAGAR vision, offering insights into India''s global positioning and various projects that complement this vision. Next, it addresses the intricacies of UDA in tropical waters, considering political, economic, and historical challenges, while contextualizing UDA within the evolving Indo-Pacific strategy. The course also emphasizes sustainability concerns in the Indian Ocean, encompassing issues such as acoustic habitat degradation, IUU fishing, pollution, and ecosystem degradation, all within the context of India''s unique tropical characteristics. Finally, it highlights the need for effective maritime governance and the imperative of a UDA framework. This section discusses regulatory challenges, decision-making dynamics, and the role of the scientific community in managing underwater domains. By encompassing these five modules, the course provides participants with a holistic and in-depth understanding of UDA''s significance and its critical role in shaping maritime security and sustainability in the modern world.', true, NOW()),
