('igot-clean-144', 'Fundamentals of Public Policy', '2h 54m', 'Indian School of Public Policy', 'This course offers an introduction to public policy. It will introduce what is public policy and discuss its relevance as a discipline. The course then introduces the key circumstances under which a problem becomes a public policy issue. It offers that market failures are the main areas that require public policy action to be initiated. However, it contends that there are different kinds of market failures. Therefore, each kind of market failure is discussed in detail. In the end, a problem set is shared to solve that provides practical questions on public policy issues.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Fundamentals of Public Policy', 'Indian School of Public Policy', 'This course offers an introduction to public policy. It will introduce what is public policy and discuss its relevance as a discipline. The course then introduces the key circumstances under which a problem becomes a public policy issue. It offers that market failures are the main areas that require public policy action to be initiated. However, it contends that there are different kinds of market failures. Therefore, each kind of market failure is discussed in detail. In the end, a problem set is shared to solve that provides practical questions on public policy issues.', true, NOW()),
('igot-clean-145', 'Developing Awareness on ESG Issues', '57m 41s', 'Steel Authority of India Limited (SAIL)', 'This course enables leaders/managers/officers/supervisors to develop awareness on ESG issues. It explains how adopting ESG measures are impacting business performance and it is in the interest of all stakeholders to implement ESG measures. After completing the course, one will be able to: - Learn about the pillars of ESG and factors comprising it. - Understand ESG Investing and its pros & cons. - Learn about the key metrics of ESG that businesses should track.', 'iGoT Karmayogi', 'Developing Awareness on ESG Issues', 'Steel Authority of India Limited (SAIL)', 'This course enables leaders/managers/officers/supervisors to develop awareness on ESG issues. It explains how adopting ESG measures are impacting business performance and it is in the interest of all stakeholders to implement ESG measures. After completing the course, one will be able to: - Learn about the pillars of ESG and factors comprising it. - Understand ESG Investing and its pros & cons. - Learn about the key metrics of ESG that businesses should track.', true, NOW()),
